    "slug": "best-stem-toys-that-kids-actually-keep-playing-with",
    "title": "Best STEM Toys That Kids Actually Keep Playing With",
    "description": "Most STEM toys get abandoned in a week. These ones have 90-day engagement data to prove they don't.",
